{
  "sequence_id": "seq_b8b5563330fdc89d",
  "texts": [
    {
      "id": "PG1:T1",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "FROBLY TAKIN’ ADVANTAGE OF THE CONFusion..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T2",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "...T' TO RCH ANOTHER VILLAGE."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T3",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Well, shit."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T4",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Times like this, you almost wish you were back in the states."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T5",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "...Hey, where'd griff go?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T6",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "HE WENT TO TAKE A LEAK."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T7",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Hey... you hear that story 'bout Billy'?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T8",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "he tripped right off his head, man. A&G the way off."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T9",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "THEY SAID HE WAS SCREAMIN' LIKE HE WAS IN HELL... FOR HOURS N’ HOURS...‘TILL I GUESS HE FINALLY GOT THERE."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T10",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "I figure they musta filmed some bad shit on him, y'know?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T11",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "OH, MY DARLIN', OH, MY DARLIN'..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T12",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "THERE THEY GO AGAIN."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T13",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "BRIGHT AS THE NIGHT IS LONG."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T1",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "DON'T CONCERN YOURSELF, SOLDIER... IT'S ALWAYS LIKE THIS IN THESE PARTS."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T2",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "We've"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T3",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "oh, my DARC/W' cle-men- tine..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T4",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "oh, my dARlin', oh, my darlin', oh, my DARK/W' cle-men-tine... 😉"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T5",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "MAN, YOU EVER NOTICE THE WAY YOU REPEAT YOURSELF?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T6",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "I DON'T KNOW THE REST OF THE SONG, SERGEANT."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T7",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "AHH... just two more days and I kiss this muddle goodbye."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T8",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "WHERE YOU FROM, KID?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T9",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "PHILA- DELPHIA, SARGE."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T1",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Family?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T2",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "TWO PARENTS AND ONE FAT-ASSED SISTER, SARGE."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T3",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "If she's black, introduce me to her."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T4",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Skrish"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T5",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T6",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Skrish"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T7",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Shit, man."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T8",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Don't scare me like that."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T9",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Sheesh!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T10",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "THAT WAS A TRUE EPIC FISS, GRIFFF."
    }
  ],
